OL,3,GNEWSANew #1 bus fares introduced for
OL,4,Aolder teenagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlder teenagers living in parts of
OL,7,FCheshire are now eligible for #1 bus
OL,8,Ffares under a new trial scheme.
OL,10,FCheshire West and Chester Council's
OL,11,FNextGenTravel Pass offers the reduced
OL,12,Ffare on services that start or end in
OL,13,Fthe area.
OL,15,FKaren Shore, deputy leader of Cheshire
OL,16,FWest and Chester Council, said the
OL,17,Fscheme would remove barriers for young
OL,18,Fpeople.
OL,20,FThe local authority said the scheme was
OL,21,Fbeing funded by the government.
